Package: unrot
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Unrot contributors <maintainers@unrot.invalid>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5)
Description: five small daily steps to get your attention back
 Unrot turns the guide "How to Unrot Your Brain" into a calm daily
 checklist: a phone curfew, time with no device, writing, exploring a
 topic, and reading for fun. No streaks, rest days allowed, and every
 step says honestly how strong the evidence is. Data stays local.
